OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe use of firearm after
OL,4,Aman found dead in Armadale
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating the use of a
OL,7,Ffirearm after a man was found dead in
OL,8,FWest Lothian.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,Freports of an injured person in a
OL,12,Fproperty on Harestanes Road, Armadale,
OL,13,Fat about 11:50 on Saturday. A
OL,14,F35-year-old man was pronounced dead at
OL,15,Fthe scene.
OL,17,FPolice Scotland said inquiries were at
OL,18,Fan early stage and a post-mortem
OL,19,Fexamination would take place, but one
OL,20,Fline of inquiry is that a firearm may
OL,21,Fhave been used.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
