OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe use of firearm after
OL,4,Aman found dead in Armadale
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force is also looking at whether a
OL,7,Fcar fire in the nearby Netherhouses
OL,8,Farea is linked to the incident.
